  "n_QU_only": 10,
  "note": "210 alone: no F-flat vacuum makes Q and u^c degenerate without d^c or e^c (all-quark, SU(5) or flipped multiplets). 45+210: real vacua with p, a and <45> along T3R (unbroken SU(3)xSU(2)xU(1)_RxU(1)_B-L) give Q = U = 0 with d^c, L, e^c, nu^c heavy, at two tuned couplings (M, eta45). E6 reading: the 650's 45 and 210 parts share one coupling, so an independent 45 coupling needs a 78 with a non-psi VEV (or a second 650)."
 },
